OL,3,GNEWSASudden school closure
OL,4,A'outrageous', MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said he is "shocked and
OL,7,Fappalled" by the sudden closure of a
OL,8,F135-year-old private school during half
OL,9,Fterm.
OL,11,FLeweston School, near Sherborne,
OL,12,FDorset, announced on its website on
OL,13,FTuesday that it would "not reopen after
OL,14,Fhalf term, and will close".
OL,16,FIn a letter to staff, Concept
OL,17,FEducation, whose subsidiary bought the
OL,18,Fschool in December 2025, said wages
OL,19,Fowed in October would not be paid.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
