OL,3,GNEWSASudden school closure
OL,4,A'outrageous', MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdward Morello, MP for West Dorset,
OL,7,Fsaid staff were given no warning and
OL,8,Fnearly 600 children had been left
OL,9,Fwithout school places.
